Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:06.309 align:start position:0%
 
[Music]  prince william and kate middleton  celebrate their 10-year wedding  anniversary with a rare home video  the couple tied the knot in a massive  ceremony at westminster abbey in 2011  and on thursday kensington palace shared  a touching video of william and kate  along with their three children  seven-year-old prince george  five-year-old princess charlotte and  three-year-old prince louis  near the family's home in norfolk  england  [Music]  the love birds captioned the sweet clip  quote thank you to everyone for the kind  messages on our wedding anniversary  we are enormously grateful for the 10  years of support we have received in our  lives as a family  w and c the timing is right now so very  happy  on wednesday the palace released two new  portraits to commemorate the milestone  one taken outside kensington palace  earlier this week by chris floyd  features the duke and duchess of  cambridge holding hands and sporting  matching blue ensembles kate in a light  blue dress  william in a blue sweater over matching  slacks  the caption 10 years and  that that's the second portrait  featuring the two in a sweet embrace  on thursday william's grandmother queen  elizabeth dedicated  instagram and twitter post to the couple  sharing throwback pics from their  wedding day alongside the caption quote  wishing the duke and duchess of  cambridge a very happy wedding  anniversary  e.t ken also confirmed that prince harry  and meghan markle privately  congratulated prince william  and kate on their milestone anniversary  which comes on the heels of a reported  falling out between the brothers after  harry and megan's bombshell interview  with oprah winfrey  i think the idea of seeing this reprisal  of the fab four  harry and megan william and kate is  really  so far down the future it's almost quite  hard to even  envisage it at the moment so much has  happened  there is so much hurt on either side i  think the first step  is william and harry getting the  relationship back on track  and then we will have to see i know it  was always harry's intention  that his children would be close to  william and kate's children he wanted  them to grow up close  as families but back to william and kate  on tuesday  the duchess tried her hand at golf while  her hubby and a group of new friends  cheered her on at the cheesy waffles  project she may have lifted on her first  swing but she  nailed it on her second  whether they're playing sports for a  good cause or spending time with their  kids by the beach  we can't get enough of this adorable  couple congrats on the milestone  [Music]  anniversary

